        "changed_workspace": true,
        "final": "Fixed the wfmt package to match the authoritative samples in assets/:\n\n1. **CRC-32**: Changed compute_crc to use standard zlib.crc32 (with final XOR), matching public test vectors. The old version was missing the final inversion step.\n\n2. **Header encoding**: Changed count field from big-endian to little-endian (struct format \">I\" → \"<I\"), matching sample.wfmt's byte order.\n\n3. **Varint decoder**: Rewrote to properly loop through multi-byte varints, distinguish \"truncated\" from \"varint\" errors, and reject non-minimal encodings.\n\n4. **Record padding**: Added 4-byte alignment padding to each record (zero bytes appended so record size is a multiple of 4), matching the sample layout.\n\n5. **Stream reader**: Rewrote iter_records to read in fixed-size chunks (never loading the full file), accumulate CRC incrementally, and validate at the end.\n\n6. **Error classification**: All structural errors now raise WFormatError with appropriate kind (\"magic\", \"version\", \"truncated\", \"structure\", \"varint\""
      }
    }
